// @test regression/lint-request-budget
// @description REQUEST_BUDGET: 41 unique request.*() calls exceeds the 40-call limit. TV's translate_light accepts this (the limit bites at runtime, not compile) - probed 2026-08-15, see INV144. Every call carries a history offset so REPAINTING_SECURITY stays out of the count.
